        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>The Way of Mending. Hands over the wound, and the weave pulled back together.</em></p><p>You restore <strong>5 Hit Points per half your level, rounded up</strong> (minimum 5) to one willing creature you touch. At 9th level you also remove one of <strong>clumsy</strong>, <strong>enfeebled</strong> or <strong>stupefied</strong>.</p><hr /><p><em>This is meant to be mediocre. You are not the party's healer, and the class does not pretend otherwise: Kaid&#333; exists so a lone Soul Reaper can stabilize a dying ally, not so the party can skip a Cleric.</em></p>"
